# A retry after a dropped connection must never create a second application. The same Idempotency-Key with
# the same body returns the same application (with a fresh token); with a different body it's refused.

@onboarding = http://localhost:5100
@key = {{$guid}}
@image = /9j/4EFUTEFTIFRFU1QgSU1BR0X/2Q==

### 1. Create.
# @name first
POST {{onboarding}}/v1/markets/MB/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{key}}

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Tester",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-01",
  "nationality": "XB",
  "countryOfResidence": "XB",
  "identifier": { "type": "NATIONAL_ID", "value": "9876543210987", "issuingCountry": "XB" },
  "email": "applicant@example.test",
  "phone": "+15550100100",
  "documents": [
    { "type": "PASSPORT", "image": "{{image}}" },
    { "type": "SELFIE", "image": "{{image}}" }
  ],
  "termsAccepted": true
}

### 2. The same request again: 201 with the same applicationId, and one identification in the journal.
POST {{onboarding}}/v1/markets/MB/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{key}}

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Tester",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-01",
  "nationality": "XB",
  "countryOfResidence": "XB",
  "identifier": { "type": "NATIONAL_ID", "value": "9876543210987", "issuingCountry": "XB" },
  "email": "applicant@example.test",
  "phone": "+15550100100",
  "documents": [
    { "type": "PASSPORT", "image": "{{image}}" },
    { "type": "SELFIE", "image": "{{image}}" }
  ],
  "termsAccepted": true
}

### 3. The same key with a different body: 422 idempotencyKey.reused.
POST {{onboarding}}/v1/markets/MB/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{key}}

{ "firstName": "Other" }

### 4. Submitting an already submitted application just reports where it is.
POST {{onboarding}}/v1/markets/MB/applications/{{first.response.body.applicationId}}/submit
X-Application-Token: {{first.response.body.applicationToken}}

### 5. One identification for the application, however many times it was sent.
GET http://localhost:5300/_control/requests?provider=idnow&keyPrefix={{first.response.body.applicationId}}
